              "text": "Danger? (धोका, dhokā.) A favour? (उपकार, upkār.) Hard work? (कष्ट, kaṣṭa.) A benefit? (फायदा, phāydā.) A loss? (तोटा, toṭā.) The neighbourhood? (शेजार, śejār.) Traffic? (वाहतूक, vāhtūk.) A passenger? (प्रवासी, pravāsī.) A queue? (रांग, rāṅg.) A crowd? (गर्दी, gardī.)"
